       - Cr\ :sub:`11`
 
 
+.. _V4L2-PIX-FMT-NV15:
+
+NV15
+----
+
+Semi-planar 10-bit YUV 4:2:0 format similar to NV12, using 10-bit components
+with no padding between each component. A group of 4 components are stored over
+5 bytes in little endian order.
